{"seq":3,"slug":"behavioral-asset-pricing","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 行为资产定价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/asset-pricing/behavioral-asset-pricing","wordCount":2914,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-金融理论-行为资产定价\">研究生 金融理论 — 行为资产定价</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>传统资产定价理论假设投资者是理性的预期效用最大化者，市场价格准确反映基本面价值。然而，股权溢价之谜、封闭式基金折价、互联网泡沫、2008 年金融危机等一系列现象严重挑战了这一假设。行为资产定价（Behavioral Asset Pricing）从心理学和认知科学中汲取洞见，将投资者的系统性认知偏差和有限套利引入定价框架。本节重点分析股权溢价之谜的行为解释（前景理论、模糊厌恶、窄框架），套利限制（Limits to Arbitrage）如何允许错误定价持续存在，以及 Shleifer &amp; Vishny (1997) 的委托代理套利模型和 DeLong-Shleifer-Summers-Waldmann（DSSW）噪声交易者模型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>核心含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>股权溢价之谜</td>\n<td>Equity Premium Puzzle</td>\n<td>观测到的股权溢价远高于标准模型预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前景理论</td>\n<td>Prospect Theory</td>\n<td>Kahneman-Tversky：损失厌恶 + 概率加权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>套利限制</td>\n<td>Limits to Arbitrage</td>\n<td>现实约束阻止理性套利者纠正错误定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声交易者风险</td>\n<td>Noise Trader Risk</td>\n<td>非理性交易者使错误定价短期扩大的风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处置效应</td>\n<td>Disposition Effect</td>\n<td>投资者过早卖出盈利股、持有亏损股</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过度自信</td>\n<td>Overconfidence</td>\n<td>高估自身信息精度导致过度交易</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-股权溢价之谜的行为解释\">一、股权溢价之谜的行为解释</h3><p>Mehra &amp; Prescott (1985) 的股权溢价之谜指出：标准 CCAPM 在合理的风险厌恶参数下无法解释约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6%</span></span></span></span></span> 的历史股权溢价。行为金融学从三个方向提供了替代解释。</p>\n<p><strong>1. 前景理论与损失厌恶（Benartzi &amp; Thaler, 1995）</strong></p>\n<p>Kahneman &amp; Tversky (1979) 的前景理论用价值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 替代效用函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>α</mi></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x) = \\begin{cases} x^\\alpha &amp; \\text{if } x \\geq 0 \\\\ -\\lambda(-x)^\\alpha &amp; \\text{if } x &lt; 0 \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span> 为损失厌恶系数（损失的心理痛苦约为等额收益的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span> 倍），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.88</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\approx 0.88</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.88</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>Benartzi &amp; Thaler 的&quot;短视损失厌恶&quot;（Myopic Loss Aversion）模型结合了两个行为因素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>损失厌恶</strong>：投资者对损失的敏感度远高于收益</li>\n<li><strong>短视评估</strong>：投资者过于频繁地评估投资组合（如每年而非每十年）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在年度评估频率下，股票亏损的概率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\text{–}40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>。对于损失厌恶的投资者，这足以要求显著的风险补偿。他们的校准结果表明，当评估期约为 1 年、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span> 时，可以解释约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6%</span></span></span></span></span> 的股权溢价——无需不合理的风险厌恶参数。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 模糊厌恶（Ambiguity Aversion）</strong></p>\n<p>Ellsberg 悖论表明人们不仅厌恶风险（已知概率分布），还厌恶模糊（不确定的概率分布本身）。在 max-min 期望效用框架下：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">P</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V = \\min_{P \\in \\mathcal{P}} E_P[U(W)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5217em;vertical-align:-0.7717em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0822em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7717em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>投资者按最不利的概率分布评估资产。当股票收益的概率分布本身存在不确定性时，模糊厌恶投资者会要求额外的&quot;模糊溢价&quot;，这叠加在传统风险溢价之上。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 窄框架与心理账户</strong></p>\n<p>Barberis &amp; Huang (2001) 认为投资者不是在整体财富层面而是在单个资产或账户层面评估盈亏——&quot;窄框架&quot;（Narrow Framing）。这意味着股票的损失厌恶效应不会被其他资产的收益所对冲，从而放大了要求的风险补偿。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-套利限制-错误定价为何持续\">二、套利限制：错误定价为何持续</h3><p>即使市场中存在非理性投资者，如果理性套利者能够自由纠正错误定价，价格仍会回归基本面。行为金融学的关键洞见是：<strong>现实中的套利面临严重约束</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>Shleifer &amp; Vishny (1997)：专业套利的限制</strong></p>\n<p>大部分套利活动由专业机构（对冲基金）执行，而非个人投资者。这些机构面临委托-代理问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[基本面价值 V] --&gt; B[市场价格 P &lt; V]&#10;    B --&gt; C{套利者买入}&#10;    C --&gt; D[短期价格进一步偏离]&#10;    D --&gt; E[投资者撤资]&#10;    E --&gt; F[被迫平仓]&#10;    F --&gt; G[错误定价持续甚至加剧]\">flowchart LR\n    A[基本面价值 V] --&gt; B[市场价格 P &lt; V]\n    B --&gt; C{套利者买入}\n    C --&gt; D[短期价格进一步偏离]\n    D --&gt; E[投资者撤资]\n    E --&gt; F[被迫平仓]\n    F --&gt; G[错误定价持续甚至加剧]</pre><p>当价格偏离基本面时，套利者借入资金买入被低估的资产。但如果噪声交易者推动价格进一步偏离，套利者面临保证金追加和投资者赎回压力（&quot;performance-based capital allocation&quot;）。在最需要加仓的时候，套利者反而被迫减仓——这就是&quot;套利者最脆弱的时候恰好是机会最大的时候&quot;悖论。</p>\n<p>1998 年 LTCM（长期资本管理公司）的崩溃是这一理论的现实注脚：LTCM 押注价差收敛，但俄罗斯债务危机导致价差扩大，追加保证金耗尽了资本。</p>\n<p><strong>主要套利限制清单</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限制类型</th>\n<th>具体表现</th>\n<th>定价含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本面风险</td>\n<td>替代品不完美，套利组合有残余风险</td>\n<td>套利者承担非对冲风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声交易者风险</td>\n<td>错误定价短期可能扩大</td>\n<td>短期亏损导致被迫平仓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实施成本</td>\n<td>卖空费用、保证金要求、交易费用</td>\n<td>小幅错误定价不值得套利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型风险</td>\n<td>基本面价值本身难以精确估计</td>\n<td>套利方向可能判断错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管约束</td>\n<td>许多机构禁止/限制卖空</td>\n<td>高估更难被纠正</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>不对称的套利限制</strong></p>\n<p>Miller (1977) 和 Hong &amp; Stein (2003) 指出，卖空限制（做空成本高、许多机构不允许做空）使得做空比做多困难得多。这导致高估比低估更容易持续——可能解释了泡沫现象的频繁出现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-噪声交易者模型-dssw\">三、噪声交易者模型（DSSW）</h3><p>DeLong, Shleifer, Summers &amp; Waldmann (1990) 构建了一个正式模型，其中噪声交易者与理性套利者共存：</p>\n<p>两类投资者：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理性交易者（比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>）：根据基本面交易</li>\n<li>噪声交易者（比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>）：对资产收益持有错误信念 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_t \\sim N(\\rho^*, \\sigma_\\rho^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1972em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>均衡价格偏离基本面的幅度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>μ</mi><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>ρ</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_t - V = \\frac{\\mu(\\rho_t - \\rho^*)}{1 + R_f} + \\frac{\\mu \\rho^*}{1 + R_f} - \\frac{\\mu^2 \\sigma_\\rho^2}{(1+R_f) \\cdot 2\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3378em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3657em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5593em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5872em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7731em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三项分别代表：(1) 噪声交易者情绪的当期波动；(2) 持续性的错误定价偏差；(3) 套利者要求的噪声交易者风险补偿。</p>\n<p>DSSW 模型的核心结论——噪声交易者不一定被市场淘汰。如果噪声交易者承担更多风险（因为过度自信），他们可能获得更高的预期收益并在长期中存活，甚至获取比理性交易者更多的财富。这颠覆了 Friedman (1953) 的经典论断——&quot;非理性交易者会被市场淘汰&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-行为偏差与市场异象\">四、行为偏差与市场异象</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行为偏差</th>\n<th>心理学基础</th>\n<th>对应的市场异象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过度自信</td>\n<td>高估自身信息精度</td>\n<td>过度交易、IPO 后长期表现不佳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表性偏差</td>\n<td>从小样本过度推断</td>\n<td>赢家/输家反转（De Bondt &amp; Thaler, 1985）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锚定效应</td>\n<td>过度依赖初始信息</td>\n<td>分析师预测偏差、52 周高点效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处置效应</td>\n<td>急于实现盈利、回避实现亏损</td>\n<td>成交量-收益率异常模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有限注意力</td>\n<td>认知资源有限</td>\n<td>盈余公告后漂移（PEAD）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架效应</td>\n<td>同一问题的不同表述改变决策</td>\n<td>股票拆分效应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>盈余公告后漂移（Post-Earnings Announcement Drift, PEAD）是最持久的异象之一：公司公布超预期盈余后，股价在 60 天内继续向上漂移。Ball &amp; Brown (1968) 首次记录了这一现象。行为解释：投资者对盈余信息反应不足（under-reaction），可能源于锚定效应和保守主义偏差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-行为与理性定价的融合\">五、行为与理性定价的融合</h3><p>近年来，&quot;行为 vs. 理性&quot;的二元对立逐渐让位于融合视角：</p>\n<p>Barberis, Shleifer &amp; Vishny (1998) 的 BSV 模型和 Daniel, Hirshleifer &amp; Subrahmanyam (1998) 的 DHS 模型分别用代表性偏差和过度自信解释了反应不足（动量）和过度反应（长期反转）的共存。</p>\n<p>Hong &amp; Stein (1999) 的信息扩散模型则不假设非理性，而是通过有限注意力和信息的逐步扩散来生成动量。</p>\n<p>更新的研究趋势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>行为宏观金融</strong>：Greenwood &amp; Shleifer (2014) 将投资者情绪指标引入宏观预测</li>\n<li><strong>实验资产市场</strong>：Smith, Suchanek &amp; Williams (1988) 的实验室泡沫实验</li>\n<li><strong>神经金融学</strong>：利用 fMRI 研究投资决策中的大脑活动</li>\n<li><strong>机器学习+行为</strong>：用 NLP 从社交媒体提取情绪指标进行预测</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>短视损失厌恶</strong>：假设一个投资者在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 2.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span></span></span></span></span> 的前景理论效用下评估股票投资。股票年收益率服从正态分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(7\\%, 16\\%)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">7%</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16%</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。(a) 计算年度频率下的亏损概率。(b) 用 Benartzi-Thaler 框架估计该投资者要求的风险溢价。(c) 如果评估频率从 1 年变为 5 年，亏损概率如何变化？这对股权溢价意味着什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>套利限制分析</strong>：2021 年 GameStop (GME) 事件中，Reddit 散户推动 GME 股价从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 1: \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\</span></span>20<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>飙升至</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">飙升至</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">飙升至</span></span></span></span></span>$483$。用 Shleifer-Vishny 框架分析做空 GME 的对冲基金为何遭受巨额亏损。&quot;这是套利限制的胜利还是市场操纵？&quot;</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>DSSW 模型推导</strong>：在 DSSW 模型中，证明当噪声交易者的乐观偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 足够大时，他们的预期效用可能高于理性交易者。这一结论对&quot;市场自然选择淘汰非理性投资者&quot;的观点意味着什么？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>行为异象检验</strong>：使用中国 A 股数据检验处置效应：计算所有投资者在盈利头寸和亏损头寸上的平均持有期。是否存在&quot;卖出赢家、持有输家&quot;的模式？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>融合视角</strong>：有人认为 Fama-French 因子（如 HML）反映的是理性风险溢价（高 B/M 公司基本面风险更大），也有人认为反映的是行为偏差（投资者对成长股过度乐观）。你如何设计实证检验来区分这两种解释？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>经典教材</strong>：Shleifer, A. (2000). <em>Inefficient Markets: An Introduction to Behavioral Finance</em>. 行为金融学的奠基之作。</li>\n<li><strong>套利限制</strong>：Shleifer, A., &amp; Vishny, R. W. (1997). &quot;The Limits of Arbitrage.&quot; <em>Journal of Finance</em>. 委托代理套利模型的原始论文。</li>\n<li><strong>短视损失厌恶</strong>：Benartzi, S., &amp; Thaler, R. H. (1995). &quot;Myopic Loss Aversion and the Equity Premium Puzzle.&quot; <em>Quarterly Journal of Economics</em>. 前景理论解释股权溢价。</li>\n<li><strong>综合综述</strong>：Barberis, N., &amp; Thaler, R. (2003). &quot;A Survey of Behavioral Finance.&quot; <em>Handbook of the Economics of Finance</em>. 行为金融学最全面的文献综述。</li>\n<li><strong>噪声交易者</strong>：DeLong, J. B., et al. (1990). &quot;Noise Trader Risk in Financial Markets.&quot; <em>Journal of Political Economy</em>. DSSW 模型原文。</li>\n<li><strong>实验视角</strong>：Hirshleifer, D. (2015). &quot;Behavioral Finance.&quot; <em>Annual Review of Financial Economics</em>. 行为金融学的最新进展综述。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>行为资产定价从两个互补的方向挑战了有效市场假说：投资者系统性偏差（前景理论、过度自信、有限注意力）解释了为什么价格会偏离基本面；套利限制（噪声交易者风险、卖空约束、委托代理问题）解释了为什么理性力量无法迅速纠正这些偏差。短视损失厌恶以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span> 和年度评估频率就能解释 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6%</span></span></span></span></span> 的股权溢价，无需标准模型中不合理的高风险厌恶参数。DSSW 模型更进一步证明噪声交易者可以在市场中长期存活。这些理论不是要否定理性金融学，而是提供了必要的补充——在&quot;市场在多大程度上是有效的&quot;这个根本问题上，真实答案介于完全有效和完全无效之间。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 金融理论 — 行为资产定价","id":"研究生-金融理论-行为资产定价"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、股权溢价之谜的行为解释","id":"一-股权溢价之谜的行为解释"},{"level":3,"text":"二、套利限制：错误定价为何持续","id":"二-套利限制-错误定价为何持续"},{"level":3,"text":"三、噪声交易者模型（DSSW）","id":"三-噪声交易者模型-dssw"},{"level":3,"text":"四、行为偏差与市场异象","id":"四-行为偏差与市场异象"},{"level":3,"text":"五、行为与理性定价的融合","id":"五-行为与理性定价的融合"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 金融理论 — 因子模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/asset-pricing/factor-models"},"next":{"title":"研究生 金融理论 — 资本结构理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/corporate-finance/capital-structure"}}